    not to hardware or to distribution in combination with proprietary software.

Components of this repository that may leverage a patent pledge are:

- scion/gateway (EP3756317B1, CN111771359B, US11240140B2)


Patent-Covered Contributions
============================

If you are contributing code that you know or believe implements a technique
covered by a patent, you are encouraged to follow the disclosure steps described
in https://docs.scion.org/en/latest/dev/contribute.html

